    << : *sim
    description       : Simulation of the test esw/demo/user.c                - Without Supervisor, Safety Lock-Step, With    Fault Injection, HWLA capture of the error injected by the push button on debug_uart_tx_o, HWLA_DEPTH 512, HWLA_PRE_TRIGGER 384, SoC clock 1.152 MHz (10 cycles per bit at 115200 baud, TCK of 10 SoC clock cycles), scenario hwla
